  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">📋 <strong>使用 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Checkraft</span> 完成本模组的所有挑战！</strong><br>✅ 追踪你的进度并分享它 — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcheckraft.com%252fchecklist%252fdecorative-storage-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处查看 Checkraft 清单</a></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-bags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1354/795/db_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"609\"></span></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<p>| <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mXqZ2WVY8h\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/838/653/ds_buttonlink.png\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\"></a> |</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@glythex_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/838/654/yt_buttonlink.png\" alt=\"查看我们的 YouTube 频道\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/yablon_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_8adcbd14-1f48-412c-98b4-f03dea701632.png\" alt=\"支持我\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">**📖 关于**</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">本模组包含多种存储解决方案，如木桶、篮子和托盘，非常适合整理和装饰你的 Minecraft 基地。无论你是需要一个时尚的容器来存放方块，还是需要一个装饰品来完善房间布置，这个模组都能满足你。使用这些物品不仅可以存储东西，还能为你的世界增添个性化的色彩！🏠 需要 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decorative-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decorative Core</a>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">**🎥 展示**</h2>\n<p><span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FDAOpR3CjKA\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">**🎨 主要特性**</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🛢️ <strong>多种类型的木桶</strong>：完美用于存放植物、方块和其他物品。</li>\n<li>🧺 <strong>篮子和托盘</strong>：时尚且实用的容器，为你的基地增添装饰风格。</li>\n<li>🏠 <strong>兼具存储与装饰功能</strong>：这些物品不仅实用，还能让你的世界看起来更棒！</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/826577/description_6908ede0-b076-4c43-9004-a486bbe18f52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"37\"></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">**📦 我的其他模组**</h2>\n<p>| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reeves-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1157/8/638724900522696872.png\" alt=\"家具模组\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fishermans-haven\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1156/589/638724431391508977.png\" alt=\"渔夫天堂模组\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/safe-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1159/366/638727999635563805.png\" alt=\"安全收获模组\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clayable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/966/827/638466363040294516.png\" alt=\"可塑粘土\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geysers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1078/863/256/256/638617579848383206.png\" alt=\"间歇泉\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bagged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1089/46/256/256/638632000601689490.png\" alt=\"袋装物品\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/uncraftable-trims-sherds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1078/190/256/256/638616623981373274.png\" alt=\"不可合成的装饰条与碎片\"></a> | | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-wood-stripping\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1086/947/256/256/638629352029916638.png\" alt=\"自动去皮机\"></a> |<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamites-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1086/957/256/256/638629361784387211.png\" alt=\"炸药重制\"></a> |</p>",
